If you enjoy dangerous adventures with elements of horror, you should immediately download Stygian: Reign of the Old Ones as a torrent. In this game, you'll closely follow the events and utilize the archetypes of people from the 1920s. After creating your character, you'll venture into Arkham, a mysterious and gloomy town renowned not only for paranormal activity but also for its cults. You can't even imagine the terrible secrets hidden within this town.

There is no turning back anymore
The dark corners of a dangerous city, its utterly dark energy, secrets, conspiracies, and a constant desire to kill — all of this is intertwined in a single city that is gradually beginning to drown in all this horror. Yes, you are free to investigate, develop the main character, and even fight. But will all this help you succeed, or is there no turning back? You can find out only after you decide to download the game Stygian: Reign of the Old Ones via torrent in Russian.

Game features
- interesting graphic style will convey every emotion of the gloomy town;
- almost everything in this game is imbued with the spirit of stories from Lovecraft himself, and this is wonderful, since he is the master of mysticism and horror;
- don’t worry, there are about 8 human archetypes to choose from, each of which will have individual abilities;
- if you suddenly come across individuals who wish to accompany you, then you should not rush to conclusions, perhaps they will reveal new details and shed light on incomprehensible things;
- carefully monitor the mental state of your main character, as the future of his abilities will depend on this, and will even influence the conduct of the conversation;
- There is magic in the game, and it will be directly created using occult tools, so before you start using it, you should think about the feasibility and consequences, which can be both negative and fatal;
- a turn-based combat system will allow you to plan your actions in advance and choose the most optimal options for achieving success;
- Remember that Arkham can become the epicenter of the creation of darkness, you must do everything to avoid such consequences.

